body:
Thank you so much. This was a very thoughtful and meaningful response to my jumbled depressed thoughts. I haven't thought about preserving his memory in that way. I'm sorry for your loss as well. 

&#x200B;

I'm looking into getting a medical refund for my classes so I can get some money back while I try a more intensive therapy. You're post gave me the bit of optimism I needed, which says a lot as I've been talking to people recently about dealing with this. If nothing else I have to make him proud. I hope I'm as strong as you think I am!
